## MCP Integration (if active)

If `mcp-server.json` is present in the project root, Kiro can read MCP tools.
MCP tools are listed in `context/mcp-tools.md`. Do not install new MCP tools without updating that file.

## Dependencies: Never Add Without Approval

- No new Maven dependencies not listed in the approved BOM / dependency manifest.
- No frontend packages not listed in the approved toolkit.
- No testing framework changes without an architecture proposal.
- For Quarkus extensions, propose the addition in `openspec/changes/` first.

## Package Naming Convention

```
{{project.java.groupId}}.<service-name>
  .domain          — Aggregates, Value Objects, Domain Events
  .application     — Commands, Queries, Handlers, DTOs
  .infrastructure  — Panache repos, messaging adapters, HTTP clients
  .resource        — Quarkus REST resources (Presentation)
  .contracts       — Shared integration contracts (DTOs, events)
```
